<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Apple Store | Product Showcase</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background: #f5f5f7;
            color: #1d1d1f;
        }

        /* ================= NAVBAR ================= */

        nav {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;

            height: 60px;

            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;

            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);

            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .nav-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1100px;

            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;

            padding: 0 25px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #333;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #0071e3;
        }

        .cart {
            font-size: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }


        /* ================= HERO ================= */

        .hero {
            min-height: 620px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            text-align: center;

            padding: 80px 20px;

            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at center,
                    #ffffff 0%,
                    #f5f5f7 60%
                );
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 850px;
        }

        .hero small {
            color: #6e6e73;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(45px, 8vw, 90px);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 10px 0;

            background: linear-gradient(
                90deg,
                #111,
                #777,
                #111
            );

            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #6e6e73;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero-img {
            width: min(500px, 90%);
            margin-top: 20px;

            filter: drop-shadow(
                0 30px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)
            );

            transition: 0.5s;
        }

        .hero-img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05) translateY(-10px);
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;

            background: #0071e3;
            color: white;

            padding: 14px 28px;

            border-radius: 30px;

            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;

            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #0077ed;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }


        /* ================= PRODUCTS ================= */

        .products {
            padding: 80px 20px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 45px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: #6e6e73;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .product-grid {
            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns:
                repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));

            gap: 25px;
        }

        .product-card {
            position: relative;

            background: white;

            border-radius: 25px;

            padding: 35px 25px;

            text-align: center;

            overflow: hidden;

            box-shadow:
                0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);

            transition: 0.4s;
        }

        .product-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);

            box-shadow:
                0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .product-card img {
            width: 220px;
            height: 250px;

            object-fit: contain;

            margin-bottom: 20px;

            transition: 0.4s;
        }

        .product-card:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.08);
        }

        .product-card h3 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .product-card .description {
            color: #6e6e73;
            min-height: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .price {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .buy-btn {
            display: inline-block;

            background: #1d1d1f;
            color: white;

            padding: 10px 22px;

            border-radius: 25px;

            text-decoration: none;

            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .buy-btn:hover {
            background: #0071e3;
        }


        /* ================= FEATURE ================= */

        .feature {
            background: #000;
            color: white;

            padding: 100px 20px;

            text-align: center;
        }

        .feature h2 {
            font-size: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .feature p {
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .feature-grid {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns:
                repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));

            gap: 20px;
        }

        .feature-box {
            padding: 30px;

            background: #1d1d1f;

            border-radius: 20px;

            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .feature-box:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            background: #252525;
        }

        .feature-box .icon {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .feature-box h3 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .feature-box p {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0;
        }


        /* ================= FOOTER ================= */

        footer {
            background: #f5f5f7;

            padding: 40px 20px;

            text-align: center;

            color: #6e6e73;

            font-size: 14px;
        }

        footer strong {
            color: #1d1d1f;
        }


        /* ================= RESPONSIVE ================= */

        @media (max-width: 700px) {

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }

            .hero {
                min-height: 550px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 18px;
            }

            .section-title h2 {
                font-size: 35px;
            }

            .feature h2 {
                font-size: 38px;
            }

        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>


<!-- ================= NAVBAR ================= -->

<nav>

    <div class="nav-container">

        <div class="logo">
            
        </div>

        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li>
                <a href="#home">หน้าแรก</a>
            </li>

            <li>
                <a href="#products">สินค้า</a>
            </li>

            <li>
                <a href="#features">จุดเด่น</a>
            </li>

            <li>
                <a href="#contact">ติดต่อ</a>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="cart">
            🛒
        </div>

    </div>

</nav>


<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->

<section class="hero" id="home">

    <div class="hero-content">

        <small>New Generation</small>

        <h1>iPhone 17 Pro</h1>

        <p>
            ทรงพลังยิ่งขึ้น<br>
            สวยงามยิ่งกว่าเดิม
        </p>

        <a href="#products" class="btn">
            ดูสินค้า
        </a>

        <br>

        <img
            class="hero-img"
            src="https://www.apple.com/v/iphone-17-pro/a/images/overview/welcome/hero_endframe__b3cjfkquc2s2_large.jpg"
            alt="iPhone"
        >

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= PRODUCTS ================= -->

<section class="products" id="products">

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>เลือกผลิตภัณฑ์ของคุณ</h2>

        <p>
            เทคโนโลยีที่ออกแบบมาเพื่อคุณ
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="product-grid">


        <!-- iPhone -->

        <div class="product-card">

            <img
                src="https://store.storeimages.cdn-apple.com/4982/as-images.apple.com/is/iphone-16-pro-finish-select-202409-6-1inch-deserttitanium?wid=400&hei=400&fmt=jpeg"
                alt="iPhone"
            >

            <h3>iPhone 16 Pro</h3>

            <p class="description">
                ชิป A18 Pro<br>
                กล้องระดับ Pro
            </p>

            <div class="price">
                เริ่มต้น ฿39,900
            </div>

            <a href="#" class="buy-btn">
                ซื้อ
            </a>

        </div>


        <!-- MacBook -->

        <div class="product-card">

            <img
                src="https://store.storeimages.cdn-apple.com/4982/as-images.apple.com/is/macbook-air-og-202402?wid=400&hei=400&fmt=jpeg"
                alt="MacBook"
            >

            <h3>MacBook Air</h3>

            <p class="description">
                บางเฉียบ น้ำหนักเบา<br>
                พร้อมชิป Apple Silicon
            </p>

            <div class="price">
                เริ่มต้น ฿34,900
            </div>

            <a href="#" class="buy-btn">
                ซื้อ
            </a>

        </div>


        <!-- iPad -->

        <div class="product-card">

            <img
                src="https://store.storeimages.cdn-apple.com/4982/as-images.apple.com/is/ipad-air-finish-select-gallery-202405-blue?wid=400&hei=400&fmt=jpeg"
                alt="iPad"
            >

            <h3>iPad Air</h3>

            <p class="description">
                จอภาพ Liquid Retina<br>
                ทรงพลังสำหรับทุกงาน
            </p>

            <div class="price">
                เริ่มต้น ฿21,900
            </div>

            <a href="#" class="buy-btn">
                ซื้อ
            </a>

        </div>


        <!-- Apple Watch -->

        <div class="product-card">

            <img
                src="https://store.storeimages.cdn-apple.com/4982/as-images.apple.com/is/watch-s10-finish-select-202409-jetblack?wid=400&hei=400&fmt=jpeg"
                alt="Apple Watch"
            >

            <h3>Apple Watch</h3>

            <p class="description">
                สุขภาพ ฟิตเนส<br>
                และการเชื่อมต่อ
            </p>

            <div class="price">
                เริ่มต้น ฿14,900
            </div>

            <a href="#" class="buy-btn">
                ซื้อ
            </a>

        </div>


    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= FEATURES ================= -->

<section class="feature" id="features">

    <h2>Designed by Apple</h2>

    <p>
        เทคโนโลยีที่ผสานระหว่างดีไซน์และประสิทธิภาพ
    </p>


    <div class="feature-grid">

        <div class="feature-box">

            <div class="icon">
                ⚡
            </div>

            <h3>ประสิทธิภาพ</h3>

            <p>
                ชิปประมวลผลประสิทธิภาพสูง
                สำหรับงานทุกประเภท
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="feature-box">

            <div class="icon">
                📸
            </div>

            <h3>กล้อง</h3>

            <p>
                ถ่ายภาพและวิดีโอคุณภาพสูง
                ได้ทุกสถานการณ์
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="feature-box">

            <div class="icon">
                🔋
            </div>

            <h3>แบตเตอรี่</h3>

            <p>
                ใช้งานได้ยาวนานตลอดทั้งวัน
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="feature-box">

            <div class="icon">
                🔒
            </div>

            <h3>ความเป็นส่วนตัว</h3>

            <p>
                ออกแบบโดยคำนึงถึงข้อมูลส่วนตัว
                ของผู้ใช้งาน
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= FOOTER ================= -->

<footer id="contact">

    <p>
        <strong> Apple Product Showcase</strong>
    </p>

    <p>
        เว็บไซต์ตัวอย่างสำหรับการเรียนรู้ HTML และ CSS
    </p>

    <br>

    <p>
        © 2026 Product Showcase
    </p>

</footer>


</body>
</html>
